    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:1",
      "title": "The Castings",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2022-03-03T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "More than one thousand five hundred people from all over Catalonia have applied for the casting of \"Euphoria\" and ninety have reached the first selection. Accompanied by Miki Núñez, they will spend three days testing their talent as soloists, as second voices and demonstrating how they move on stage. Excitement and nerves fill the set of the casting. They dance, sing, laugh and get to know each other. At the end of the day, the jury made up of top professionals such as Jordi Cubino, Daniel Anglès, Carol Rovira, Albert Sala and Aina Casanovas will decide which of the forty singers will make it to the final stage.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638154
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:2",
      "title": "The Final Selection",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2022-03-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The final selection for the \"Euphoria\" casting begins. Just two days separate some of our contestants from becoming the protagonists of the biggest musical show of the season.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638156
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:3",
      "title": "Live Show 1",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2022-03-18T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The adventure finally begins. After the castings, the 16 selected open the competition to get a record contract to embark on a musical and artistic career. This Friday they will live their first night on a total stage that will be the delight of lovers of great shows.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638157
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:4",
      "title": "Live Show 2",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2022-03-25T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The twelve contestants who came out of the first gala begin the real euphoric competition. They will have to defend the individual themes and the second voices that have been prepared during the week. And they will do it with an important novelty: the favorite. It is a new mechanic that will allow members of the jury to nominate a contestant who will enjoy full immunity.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638158
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:5",
      "title": "Live Show 3",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2022-04-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The third is the good one. This is what the contestants of \"Euphoria\" must have thought before their performance at the third gala of the season. Each and every one has given their best on stage, raising the level of the program one more week!",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/5/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638159
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:6",
      "title": "Live Show 4",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2022-04-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "We arrived at the fourth gala of the season with ten participants. When it's over, there will be only nine left. The competition is getting tougher.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/6/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638160
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:7",
      "title": "The Road to Eufòria",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 7,
      "number": 7,
      "released": "2022-04-15T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "After just four weeks, \"Euphoria\" has become a phenomenon. The possible explanations for this phenomenon may be many, but surely they all have two things in common: some spectacular performances and some talented contestants. The time has come to relive some of the best moments that have left us these weeks and, moreover, to see unpublished and exclusive images of the castings of our euphoric and euphoric. Get ready to make with us a path full of music, the path to \"Euphoria.\"",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/7/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3638161
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:8",
      "title": "Live Show 5",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 8,
      "number": 8,
      "released": "2022-04-22T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "This Friday's gala will be the last where only the set audience will be able to vote. From now on, voting will be open to everyone and the fate of the contestants will be in the hands of the entire audience. With the elimination of the Light at the fourth gala, there are only nine contestants left in the race to get a record deal.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/8/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3657141
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:9",
      "title": "Live Show 6",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 9,
      "number": 9,
      "released": "2022-04-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The hour of truth is coming. There are only eight contestants left in the race to find the most complete voice in Catalonia and, from now on, it will be precisely the whole of Catalonia that decides who deserves this honor.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/9/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3675683
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:10",
      "title": "Live Show 7",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 10,
      "number": 10,
      "released": "2022-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The ex-contestants of \"Euphoria\" have had a second chance to rejoin the contest and fight to get a record contract: a gala for themselves, in which they have acted as solo singers while the contestants who are still in the contest have been the second voices. The surprise of the night: in the end there were two, the repescados!",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/10/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3707579
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:11",
      "title": "Live Show 8",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 11,
      "number": 11,
      "released": "2022-05-13T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The eighth gala regains the momentum of eliminations and a contestant will have to leave the program. After a gala rematch where the public has decided that Edu and Claudia will rejoin the race to find the most complete voice in Catalonia, the program returns to the dynamics of competition. This Friday one of the 9 participants who are still in the competition will have to leave it, now yes, for good.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/11/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3707580
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:12",
      "title": "Live Show 9",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 12,
      "number": 12,
      "released": "2022-05-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "With the semifinals and the final on the horizon, in June, \"Euphoria\" is still the final stretch of the season with a novelty: next Friday we will know the name of the first semifinalist of the program. And whoever finishes the ninth gala sitting in the favorite chair will enjoy extra immunity.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/12/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3742371
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:13",
      "title": "Live Show 10",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 13,
      "number": 13,
      "released": "2022-05-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The next gala marks a point of no return in the season: we are about to enter the final phase and only six contestants, of the sixteen who started the adventure, will be able to access it.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/13/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3742372
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:14",
      "title": "Live Show 11",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 14,
      "number": 14,
      "released": "2022-06-03T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The first semifinal of \"Euphoria\" is here. The six contestants who are still in the race start the final stage and do so with new features. The first is that the gala will include the duet mode. There will be two types of performances: solo and in pairs. The second news is that on Friday we will know the name of the first finalist, who will finish the gala as a favorite.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/14/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3742373
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:15",
      "title": "Semifinal",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 15,
      "number": 15,
      "released": "2022-06-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The countdown has begun. The anteroom to the grand finale is here. This Friday we will know the names of the three finalists who on June 17 will choose to become the winner of the contest.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/15/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3792204
    },
    {
      "id": "tt18358210:1:16",
      "title": "Finale",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 16,
      "number": 16,
      "released": "2022-06-17T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "All of them are already stars, but only one can remain. The contest reaches its climax: we finally find out who takes the victory in the television adventure of the season. Whoever does so will enjoy a record contract, sing with Miki Núñez the summer song of TV3 and Catalunya Ràdio, take part in the La Marató album and, of course, become one of the Catalan voices of the moment.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt18358210/1/16/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3792205
    },
